"text": "← Back to Portfolio Sample course · Articulate Rise 360 Humanizing AI-Generated Content Spot the telltale signs of AI-generated writing, then edit it into something that sounds like a person wrote it. AI can draft polished text in seconds, but on its own it smooths away the voice, detail, and insight that make training stick. I built this short course for the people who write our training and communications: how to recognize the patterns AI leaves behind, practical edits that put the human back in, and habits that keep your own writing standing out. Audience: Anyone who writes or edits training, communications, or other content with help from AI tools. Open the course full screen Tip: the course has its own menu (top left). It works best in the full-screen version . Lessons Recognize: Telltale Signs of Gen-AI Humanize: Edit for Authenticity Internalize: Standout Writing Practices in Content Creation Design features Narrated audio Writing with AI Knowledge checks Sorting activities Flashcards Accordions Interactive tabs Before-and-after edits ← Back to Portfolio"
