"text": "← Back to Portfolio Sample course · Articulate Rise 360 Commercial Property Security Standards (Jacksonville, Florida) Post orders for officers at a commercial office property: duties and conduct, access control, property handling, documentation, and emergencies. I built this course to replace a long post-orders document with something officers actually finish. It covers the two security roles on site (lobby officer and security desk), professional conduct and customer service, visitor and access control, property removal, lost and found, and keys, incident documentation (with a video walkthrough), communication tools, and emergency and escalation procedures, ending with a quiz. Audience: Security officers and supervisors assigned to a commercial office property. Open the course full screen Tip: the course has its own menu (top left). It works best in the full-screen version . Lessons Main Duties, Expectations, and Professional Conduct Procedures for Access Control, Property Handling, and Documentation Handling Emergencies, Escalation, and Special Situations Quiz Design features Post orders Video walkthrough Knowledge checks Interactive tabs Accordions Flashcards Customer service Final quiz ← Back to Portfolio"
